        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(c) Effective January 1, 2001, sixty percent of the Company's matching contribution shall be invested in MCN stock or successor Employer stock. The employee may direct the investment of the remaining forty percent of the Company's matching contribution in MCN stock or successor Employer stock, or any other fund available in the Plan. With the effective date of this change, the additional fifteen percent – the difference between the new forty percent and the prior twenty-five percent – will be invested in the same funds as the employee has directed for his or her twenty-five percent Company match. The employee may change the investment direction of the forty percent portion of the Company match on a daily basis.",
            "block_bbox": [
